From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:48:59 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Show event summary on the admin dashboard

The admin dashboard shows the total of events and enrollments, events per kind and the next three events. Event::countByKind uses GROUP BY, Event::upcoming filters starts_on from today ordered by date with LIMIT, and Enrollment::total uses COUNT(*), all in the models.
